sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Interface
    participant API
    participant Business Logic
    participant Database

    User->>Interface: Open registration form
    User->>Interface: Enter registration details
    Interface->>API: Submit registration request
    API->>Business Logic: Validate data
    Business Logic->>Database: Check if user exists
    Database-->>Business Logic: Return user existence status
    alt User exists
        Business Logic-->>API: Return error (User already exists)
        API-->>Interface: Show error message
    else User does not exist
        Business Logic->>Database: Save new user
        Database-->>Business Logic: Confirmation
        Business Logic-->>API: Return success
        API-->>Interface: Show success message
    end
    Interface-->>User: Display registration result
